={
  "model": "gpt-4o-mini",
  "temperature": 0,
  "max_tokens": 600,
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a B2B software analyst evaluating Customer Success Platform vendors. Score the vendor's help/docs content across 6 feature dimensions. Return ONLY valid JSON with no extra text."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Vendor: {{ $json.vendor_name }}\nHelp site content (excerpt):\n{{ $json.crawl_text }}\n\nScore this vendor's feature depth across these 6 dimensions (0-10 each, 0=no evidence, 10=deep documented feature set):\n1. integrations - documented integrations with third-party tools\n2. automation - workflow automation, playbook, trigger/action capabilities\n3. reporting - analytics, dashboards, custom reports\n4. onboarding - guided onboarding, implementation support features\n5. collaboration - team collaboration, internal notes, shared views\n6. api_developer - API access, webhooks, developer documentation\n\nAlso extract up to 10 specific feature signals (plain English capability names found in the content).\n\nReturn JSON: {\"scores\": {\"integrations\": N, \"automation\": N, \"reporting\": N, \"onboarding\": N, \"collaboration\": N, \"api_developer\": N}, \"feature_signals\": [\"signal1\", ...]}"
    }
  ]
}

